execution/v2.4/receipts/W05/W05-99/qualification_failure_revision02_architecture_codex/20261015-current-chat\D-ARCHITECTURE.md:23:Outer Artifact input_refs are immutable profile ref plus prior closure Artifact and prior lineage Artifact when present; all must be validated exact versions. Old Run/Task/NoProgressRecord revisions are historical subject hashes inside the envelope, not new Task inputs. No `runtime_uploads`, `artifact_uses` or `artifact_use_proofs` row is created for this non-Run Artifact. Existing seal with run_id=null records only the upload, Artifact/ref/version and DERIVED_FROM ImpactLinks for its outer refs. Do not use recoverArtifact, which assigns the old executor and original Run.
